ANNOTATION: "SEP-DWUPSIZER-CONST-HEADER: the only instance is u_axi_dw_upsizer_dma (hw/sys/sep/rtl/sep_dma_wrap.sv:289). Its slave port is driven by u_axi_lite_to_axi_dma (hw/sys/sep/rtl/sep_dma_wrap.sv:263), which synthesises a constant AXI header: burst = axi_pkg::BURST_FIXED and size = AxiSize (vendor/pulp-platform/axi/upstream/src/axi_lite_to_axi.sv:43-44 for AR and :60-61 for AW), with len, lock, qos, region, user, id and atop forced to zero by default: '0 (:46, :63, :67). cache is tied 4'b0000 at hw/sys/sep/rtl/sep_dma_wrap.sv:266 and :267, so axi_pkg::modifiable() (vendor/pulp-platform/axi/upstream/src/axi_pkg.sv:226) returns constant 0. The upsizer is therefore a pure passthrough: every upsizing arm, both BURST_INCR / BURST_WRAP decodes and the R_INJECT_AW state are cut off by RTL, not by stimulus. Excluded on every generate copy because the tie applies to all of them. NOT excluded: the remaining uncovered lines in generate copies t = 1..7, which are reachable (AxiMaxReads = 8 at sep_dma_wrap.sv:273) and are an outstanding-read depth gap, not structure."
